1
00:00:01,133 --> 00:00:02,267
<i> Saranghae.</i>

2
00:00:03,367 --> 00:00:05,267
<i> Saranghae...</i> too.

3
00:00:05,267 --> 00:00:12,167
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

4
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,700
[CHUCKLES]

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:18,433
- Just kidding!
- [MUSIC STOPS]

6
00:00:18,433 --> 00:00:22,500
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,767
What does that mean?

8
00:00:23,767 --> 00:00:26,200
It means "joke."
It's just a joke.

9
00:00:27,433 --> 00:00:30,133
So this is just a joke?

10
00:00:30,133 --> 00:00:32,033
You don't really love me at all?

11
00:00:32,033 --> 00:00:38,700
[PLAYFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

12
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:41,733
Just kidding.

13
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:45,033
[LAUGHING]

14
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,400
Cheers.

15
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:50,267
In Tagalog, it's shot puno!

16
00:00:50,267 --> 00:00:52,567
<i>- Shot puno?
- [LAUGHS]</i>

17
00:00:52,567 --> 00:00:53,700
<i> Shot puno!</i>

18
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:56,300
[LAUGHS]

19
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:57,567
[WHISPERS] Oh my goodness!

20
00:00:57,567 --> 00:00:58,667
Drink up!

21
00:00:58,667 --> 00:01:04,300
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]

22
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,600
Uh! [COUGHS]

23
00:01:06,667 --> 00:01:08,767
[GIGGLING]

24
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:11,767
Why are you looking
at me like that?

25
00:01:11,767 --> 00:01:13,533
Drink! Drink!

26
00:01:14,567 --> 00:01:17,833
Don't look at me like that,
I can't handle it!

27
00:01:17,833 --> 00:01:20,267
[HANNAH SQUEALING]

28
00:01:20,267 --> 00:01:24,800
[ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

29
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,233
Ahh!

30
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:30,200
You're the only one drinking.
Give me some.

31
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:32,400
I'll open another! You!

32
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,333
- Why are you--
<i> - Shot puno!</i>

33
00:01:34,333 --> 00:01:35,833
Yes!

34
00:01:35,833 --> 00:01:37,467
That's it, sir.

35
00:01:37,467 --> 00:01:39,400
[GLASSES CLINK]

36
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:46,333
[ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

37
00:01:46,367 --> 00:01:53,233
[MUSIC BECOMES SENSUAL]

38
00:02:05,567 --> 00:02:07,133
It's hot!

39
00:02:07,133 --> 00:02:08,833
It's really hot.

40
00:02:08,833 --> 00:02:13,233
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

41
00:02:13,233 --> 00:02:14,733
It's hot! Whoo!

42
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,600
It's so hot, right?

43
00:02:17,600 --> 00:02:19,200
Very hot.

44
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:20,467
Whoo!

45
00:02:20,467 --> 00:02:22,533
[HANNAH BREATHING HEAVILY]

46
00:02:22,533 --> 00:02:24,400
It's very hot.

47
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,133
Oh my gosh! Oh my gosh!

48
00:02:26,133 --> 00:02:27,500
It's so hot!

49
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:31,600
Ah, sir, I'll just get
some water.

50
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,800
It's so hot.

51
00:02:35,333 --> 00:02:36,767
- Uh.
- Hey.

52
00:02:36,767 --> 00:02:43,667
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYING]
